<main>

<section>

<h2>
Partner With Free Reliable Appliance Pickup
</h2>

<p>
We are building a nationwide network of reliable local appliance pickup
operators. Qualified partners may receive appliance pickup opportunities
in approved service areas when customer demand is available.
</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<h3>
Local Pickup Opportunities
</h3>

<p>
Receive qualifying appliance pickup opportunities in your approved service area.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>
Choose Your Cities
</h3>

<p>
Build a standard territory by selecting up to 50 cities.
Larger territories may be reviewed separately.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>
Grow Your Operation
</h3>

<p>
Add potential pickup opportunities without depending only on your own advertising.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>
Nationwide Expansion
</h3>

<p>
Partner opportunities may be available across all 50 U.S. states
as the network expands.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="how-it-works">

<h2>
How the Partner Program Works
</h2>

<ol class="steps">

<li>
Choose the state where you want to operate.
</li>

<li>
Browse cities by A–Z or search by city name.
</li>

<li>
Tap a city to add it to your requested territory.
</li>

<li>
Choose up to 50 cities for a standard territory request.
</li>

<li>
If you cannot find a city, type it manually and add it.
</li>

<li>
Submit your partner application for review.
</li>

</ol>

</section>


